  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### Client User Access to Payroll\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 22 Jun, 2021 at  3:25 PM\n\nPlease click here to watch what a client can access in payroll when given permission\n\nYou can give your client users access to view payroll by going to My Admin> Users> Edit User> Modules and click on payroll.\n\nHelp/Guide: \n\nWhen the client logs in to their user account they will see a payroll summary for their company\n\nWhen clicking on manage payroll they can see\n\nemployees (but not add)\nadd departments\nadd Mileage claims/expense claims\nadd timekeeping records for hourly paid employees\nprint payslips\n\nThey will be able to access the following reports\n\nPayroll summary\nPeriodic tax\nMileage and expense claim reports\n\nDepartmental reports\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188533\">Payroll Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Client User Access to Payroll\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 22 Jun, 2021 at  3:25 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><br><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/7ce86aacc8fb4adb9f7769d97a586538\">Please click here to watch what a client can access in payroll when given permission</a></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">You can give your client users access to view payroll by going to My Admin&gt; Users&gt; Edit User&gt; Modules and click on payroll.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9132825971/original/Fk8E3x8OcVxY-DWm6BNozPJbaPP_sVH6Mg.png?1624371318\" style=\"width: 718px;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9132825971\"></span><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong style='box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><br style='box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><strong style='box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>Help/Guide:</strong> </span></strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">When the client logs in to their user account they will see a payroll summary for their company</span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9132826331/original/c7y27weHqD73_QZxVPY2O8a91Rx6glUGzA.png?1624371481\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9132826331\"></span></span></p><p><br></p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\">When clicking on manage payroll they can see</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">employees (but not add)</li></ul><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">add departments</li></ul><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">add Mileage claims/expense claims</li></ul><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">add timekeeping records for hourly paid employees</li></ul><ul><li dir=\"ltr\">print payslips</li></ul></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9132826433/original/MsTk7NW7U1YYQeEyVpPxAX88IYsb5Pb3Hw.png?1624371551\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9132826433\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">They will be able to access the following reports</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Payroll summary</span></li></ul><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Periodic tax</span></li></ul><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetic